{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"柏拉图·life-and-times","stage":"DONE","category":"plato","categoryLabel":"柏拉图","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.91,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":3,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/21_plato/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<p>本 hub 讲述柏拉图（约公元前 428/427—前 348/347）的<strong>生平与时代</strong>——他是谁、出自怎样的家族、在怎样的城邦动荡中成长，又如何从一位本该从政的雅典贵族，一步步走成西方哲学的奠基者。这是传记线，不是思想线：它回答&quot;他经历了什么、为什么转向哲学&quot;，而把&quot;他主张什么、用什么方法&quot;交给兄弟 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一条主线-被现实逼成哲学家\">一条主线：被现实逼成哲学家</h2><p>柏拉图的一生有一个贯穿性的张力——<strong>从政的抱负 vs 现实的幻灭</strong>。出身把他推向政坛，但寡头暴政、苏格拉底之死、叙拉古的惨败一次次击碎他的政治希望，最终他在学园里找到了改造世界的另一条路：不是统治君主，而是培养追求真理的人。读本 hub，请抓住这条线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[&quot;显赫出身\\n本该从政&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;两次政治幻灭\\n寡头+民主&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;遇见苏格拉底\\n找到新方向&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;苏格拉底之死\\n志业被焊死&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;游历+三访叙拉古\\n理想撞碎&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;创立学园\\n理想以教育落地&quot;]\">graph LR\n  A[\"显赫出身\\n本该从政\"] --&gt; B[\"两次政治幻灭\\n寡头+民主\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"遇见苏格拉底\\n找到新方向\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"苏格拉底之死\\n志业被焊死\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"游历+三访叙拉古\\n理想撞碎\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"创立学园\\n理想以教育落地\"]</pre><h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p>无需哲学前置知识，建议按章节顺序读，因果链最清晰：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"an-athenian-aristocrat/birth-and-family\">出身与家世</a> — 家族网络、生卒年的不确定性、僭主亲属</li>\n<li><a href=\"an-athenian-aristocrat/youth-and-ambition\">青年与抱负</a> — 从政抱负如何被两次幻灭逼向哲学</li>\n<li><a href=\"disciple-of-socrates/meeting-socrates\">遇见苏格拉底</a> — 师承的性质与&quot;苏格拉底问题&quot;</li>\n<li><a href=\"disciple-of-socrates/the-death-of-socrates\">苏格拉底之死的震撼</a> — 前 399 年的审判与其重定向作用</li>\n<li><a href=\"travels-and-the-academy/travels-and-syracuse\">游历与叙拉古</a> — 三访西西里、&quot;哲学王&quot;实验的失败</li>\n<li><a href=\"travels-and-the-academy/founding-the-academy\">创立学园</a> — 西方第一所研究机构与亚里士多德</li>\n</ol>\n<p>读完本 hub，建议接着读 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a> 看他&quot;怎么想、怎么求真&quot;，或 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a> 看他主张了什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>柏拉图的整套 hub 群按&quot;生平—贡献—思想—著作—影响—评价&quot;分工，本 hub 专注&quot;生平与时代&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>1·生平与时代（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>出身、师承、游历、办学园</td>\n<td>提供其余各 hub 的传记与历史背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2·核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>理念论、《理想国》、学园</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲&quot;学园怎么建&quot;，它讲&quot;学园的哲学地位&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3·思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>知识论、灵魂学说、辩证法</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲&quot;他怎样找到方法&quot;，它讲&quot;方法本身&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4·主要著作</a></td>\n<td>早/中/晚期对话分期</td>\n<td>本 hub 提及的对话（《申辩》《斐多》《法律》），它逐篇导读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5·影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>柏拉图主义、对科学神学的影响</td>\n<td>承接学园身后九百年的流变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6·争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>理念论困难、极权之争</td>\n<td>对&quot;哲学王&quot;等本 hub 提到的理想作批判</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>本 hub 讲&quot;柏拉图经历了什么、为何转向哲学&quot;，其余 hub 讲&quot;他想出了什么、留下了什么&quot;。</strong> 凡涉及学说细节（理念论、辩证法、理想国方案），本 hub 只点到为止并给出跨链，不重复展开。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"an-athenian-aristocrat","title":"An Athenian Aristocrat","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/an-athenian-aristocrat","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"birth-and-family","title":"出身与家世","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/an-athenian-aristocrat/birth-and-family"},{"seq":2,"slug":"youth-and-ambition","title":"青年与抱负","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/an-athenian-aristocrat/youth-and-ambition"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"disciple-of-socrates","title":"Disciple Of Socrates","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/disciple-of-socrates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"meeting-socrates","title":"遇见苏格拉底","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/disciple-of-socrates/meeting-socrates"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-death-of-socrates","title":"苏格拉底之死的震撼","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/disciple-of-socrates/the-death-of-socrates"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"travels-and-the-academy","title":"Travels And The Academy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/travels-and-the-academy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"travels-and-syracuse","title":"游历与叙拉古","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/travels-and-the-academy/travels-and-syracuse"},{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-the-academy","title":"创立学园","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/travels-and-the-academy/founding-the-academy"}]}]}